[h1]EoE + Ethnicities & Portraits Expanded[/h1]

Compatibility patch for [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3679840613]Embers of Empire - A Roman Restoration[/url] and [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2507209632]Ethnicities & Portraits Expanded[/url].

[h2]Give The Empire A Face[/h2]

From the imperial court in Rome to the peoples living along its distant frontiers, a restored empire should look as varied as the world it rules. This patch brings EoE's Roman cultures and characters together with EPE's portraits and appearance system while preserving the flavor of both mods.

[hr][/hr]
[h2]Latest Update - Version 1.18.3.1[/h2]

[list]
[*]Updated the Latin and Frankish cultures for the current EoE and EPE versions.
[*]Added missing English culture-flavor text.
[*]Updated compatibility and load-order guidance for CK3 1.19.
[/list]
[hr][/hr]

[h2]Requirements[/h2]

[list]
[*]Embers of Empire - A Roman Restoration
[*]Ethnicities & Portraits Expanded
[/list]

[h2]Load Order[/h2]

[list=1]
[*]Embers of Empire
[*]Ethnicities & Portraits Expanded
[*][b]EoE + EPE[/b]
[/list]

Start a new campaign after major culture updates. If a Roman court suddenly looks out of place, report your complete playset, load order, and CK3 version.
